Scope

This MIT licence covers the Billworld code in this repository: the simulator,
the benchmark runner, scorer and export, and the tests.

The benchmark task data and dataset card (billworld/benchmark/data/ and
billworld/benchmark/README.md) are licensed separately under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International; see billworld/benchmark/LICENSE-DATA.

Not covered by either licence: third-party material. Pages, screenshots,
images, logos, PDFs and other assets captured from real billers' websites
belong to their owners, are not licensed here and are not part of the
benchmark dataset export. Vendored third-party code keeps its own licence (for
example billworld/public/gmail/LICENSE).
